# Pegasus messaging

- Content scripts never call `chrome.runtime.sendMessage` / `browser.runtime` for feature traffic, and never import background-only modules.
- Cross-context traffic goes through Pegasus (`definePegasusMessageBus` / RPC / Pegasus store).
- Workers own Zustand stores in the service worker; content scripts and popup read/mutate via Pegasus-backed stores.
- Dual-manifest: do not assume MV3-only APIs in shared paths without a Firefox path.
- Prefer `@utils`, `@store`, feature aliases over deep relative imports.
